  "displayNameJa": "水穂",
  "displayNameEn": "Mizuho",
  "description": "Non-profit religious-corp water + sanitation substrate. Community-scale only (NOT large municipal utility, N1). Upstream of mitsuho (irrigation), hagukumi (daily-living water), iyashi (clinical-grade), yakushi (WFI feed). NO commercial water utility software (G4: Veolia/Suez/American Water/Aquarion/Évian/Nestlé Pure Life/Beck Water/Trojan UV PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c)). NO bottled water vendor (G5: single-use plastic PROHIBITED per Charter §1.13). NO mandatory fluoridation (G6: per-member consent). Greywater recycling MANDATORY for new construction (G10). Water-source rights honor waqf-equivalent inalienability (G11 per ADR-2605192245). 6 cells / 5 Lexicons / 12 gates / 12 non-goals.",
  "descriptionJa": "非営利 religious-corp の水道+下水 substrate。コミュニティ規模のみ (大規模水道事業者にはならない)。mitsuho 灌漑 / hagukumi 日常生活水 / iyashi 臨床グレード / yakushi WFI 原水 の上流。商業水道ソフトウェア禁止 (Veolia/Suez/American Water/Aquarion/Évian/Nestlé Pure Life/Beck Water/Trojan UV PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c))。ボトル水 vendor 禁止 (使い捨てプラスチック PROHIBITED per Charter §1.13)。フッ素化義務化なし (member 同意必要)。新規建設で雑排水リサイクル必須 (G10)。水源権は waqf 不可侵 inalienability 継承 (G11 per ADR-2605192245)。",
  "namingCollisionNote": "Romanization-homophone with mitsuho (瑞穂; food/agriculture, ADR-2605261015). Filesystem paths (mizuho/ vs mitsuho/) + DIDs (did:web:mizuho.etzhayyim.com vs did:web:mitsuho.etzhayyim.com) disambiguate. User explicitly proposed mizuho (水穂) in gap audit row 4.",
  "adr": {
